WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.215
- So, in the past two, three days,

00:00:01.287 --> 00:00:03.291
Elon Musk has been
having a meltdown on Twitter.

00:00:03.347 --> 00:00:06.159
First he came out against ESG
scores, which essentially determines

00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:10.084
how environmentally conscious,
socially aware, and ethical a company is.

00:00:10.141 --> 00:00:11.726
Elon claims that ESG ratings are a scam,

00:00:11.773 --> 00:00:14.270
which have been weaponized
by social justice warriors.

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:16.142
He then claimed that,
"political attacks against him

00:00:16.196 --> 00:00:18.126
will escalate dramatically
in the coming months."

00:00:18.198 --> 00:00:19.488
And then he posted this.

00:00:19.539 --> 00:00:22.081
According to Elon Musk, the real
purpose of the ESG scores,

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:24.934
is to determine how compliant your
business is with "the leftist agenda",

00:00:25.046 --> 00:00:25.912
whatever that is.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.304
Shortly after he came out
as a Republican, writing that

00:00:28.352 --> 00:00:31.225
in the past he voted Democrat because
they were the mostly kindness party,

00:00:31.273 --> 00:00:34.782
but they have become the party of division
and hate, so he can no longer support them.

00:00:34.902 --> 00:00:36.630
And underneath his post
we have Lauren Boebert,

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:38.638
crazy Republican
far-right QAnon believer,

00:00:38.696 --> 00:00:40.746
congratulating him
for joining the right side.

00:00:40.841 --> 00:00:44.089
And then, woah! What's this? An article
came out on <i>Business Insider,</i>

00:00:44.137 --> 00:00:47.355
claiming that Elon Musk sexually
harassed a SpaceX flight attendant.

00:00:47.411 --> 00:00:50.308
Wow! So, was Elon Musk
actually correct about something?

00:00:50.348 --> 00:00:53.533
Did those far-left, insane SJWs
really go on the offensive against him

00:00:53.573 --> 00:00:55.573
after he turned towards the Republican Party?

00:00:55.653 --> 00:00:58.318
Of course not. Elon Musk
is lying to you, as usual.

00:00:58.366 --> 00:01:01.159
The real reason for Elon Musk's
Twitter meltdown is as follows.

00:01:01.199 --> 00:01:04.048
On the 18th of May in the morning,
Elon Musk was sitting around, salty,

00:01:04.088 --> 00:01:07.185
after Tesla was kicked out of
the S&amp;P 500's ESG index.

00:01:07.241 --> 00:01:11.087
Based on the CNBC article, this happened
due to Tesla's lack of low-carbon strategy,

00:01:11.143 --> 00:01:14.544
and the codes of business conduct, along
with racism and poor working conditions

00:01:14.584 --> 00:01:16.597
at Tesla's Fremont factory in California.

00:01:16.637 --> 00:01:20.404
Then, at approximately 9 AM, people from the
<i>Business Insider</i> reached out to him in private,

00:01:20.436 --> 00:01:23.126
asking him to comment on the story,
which was not yet published.

00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:24.902
And this was the story I showed you earlier.

00:01:24.958 --> 00:01:27.904
The one about Elon Musk sexually
harassing a SpaceX employee.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.990
And before the article would go live,
he quickly posted this:

00:01:33.953 --> 00:01:36.964
And then he made a post about being
a Republican, and then the article came out,

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:38.449
approximately one day later.

00:01:38.489 --> 00:01:41.890
So, yeah. What's happening here is Elon Musk
trying to get out of a sexual harassment

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:45.008
accusation by framing it as some sort of
baseless political attack

00:01:45.048 --> 00:01:47.069
by the insane SJW far-left.

00:01:47.141 --> 00:01:50.331
And in that process, he gets to publicly align
himself with the political party he has always

00:01:50.371 --> 00:01:53.460
been aligned with basically. You know,
Republicans, anti-union, anti-worker,

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:55.344
anti-anti-racism, and so on.

00:01:55.392 --> 00:01:57.964
So Elon is just being the usual
piece of shit he has always been,

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.632
he's just now being more open about it.

00:01:59.703 --> 00:02:01.683
And that's what's behind #ElonGate.

